/-!
# Geometric measure theory

The first varifold layer follows Simon's Radon-measure definition in a Euclidean
ambient space. It includes the compact Grassmannian of unoriented planes, weight
measures, the Hausdorff weak-* topology, and finite-area `C^1` parametrizations with
an explicit measurable tangent lift. See each module for precise scope and references.
-/
